PermanentalThree.lower_certificate (x b c w : ℝ) :
  (x - 1) *
      (3 * PermanentalThree.normalizedNumerator x (x + b) (x + c) w -
        2 * PermanentalThree.normalizedDenominator x (x + b) (x + c) w) =
    2 * x ^ 2 * (x - 1) ^ 2 + 2 * x * (x + 1) * (x - 1) * (b + c) + (2 * x ^ 2 + 3 * (x - 1)) * b * c +
      x * (x + 1) * PermanentalThree.normalizedDet x (x + b) (x + c) w
'PermanentalThree.lower_certificate' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
PermanentalThree.upper_certificate (x b c w : ℝ) :
  (x - 1) *
      (9 * PermanentalThree.normalizedDenominator x (x + b) (x + c) w -
        8 * PermanentalThree.normalizedNumerator x (x + b) (x + c) w) =
    2 * x ^ 3 * (x - 1) + 20 * x ^ 2 * (x - 1) + 2 * x * (x + 1) * (x - 1) * (b + c) + 2 * (x - 2) ^ 2 * b * c +
      x * (x + 1) * PermanentalThree.normalizedDet x (x + b) (x + c) w
'PermanentalThree.upper_certificate' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
